  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lsa 303.02 Re-Examinations. Candidates failing an examination shall be entitled to one re-examination for the same application.\n\nSource. #8861, eff 3-28-07; ss by #10679, eff 9-30-14; ss by #14168, eff 3-10-25",
